      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039410133333
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit, my name is Charlie. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039413199999
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return an item. Just give me a yes or no, can I do it?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92509,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039418466665
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Do you have your order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039422933331
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's VF-881-3045. It's a helmet. Can I return it?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92509,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039428199997
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, one moment while I pull up that order, VF-881-3045... I see the Trail Helmet here. What specifically is the issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039431999997
    },
    {
      "text": "There's no issue. It's the wrong color. The box is unopened. I just need a return label.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92509,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039440199997
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. Let me just confirm the purchase date... Okay, I see this was delivered 62 days ago. Let me check the policy for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039446266663
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, I don't need a long story. Just tell me if I can send it back.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92509,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039455199996
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, you can. Our policy for this helmet allows for returns up to 90 days after delivery. Since you're within that window, I can go ahead and approve this for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039459933329
    },
    {
      "text": "Finally. So you're sending a label?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92509,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039470999995
    },
    {
      "text": "That's correct. Since the box is unopened and it's a matter of color preference, it falls right within our guidelines. We want to ensure you're happy with your gear, as your safety is our top priority. I've just sent a pre-paid return label to the email on file. You should receive it momentarily.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039473533328
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. Got it. That's all I needed.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92509,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767039493533328
    },
